WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.103
Venus.

00:01.803 --> 00:08.712
The brightest thing in the night sky after the Moon, and the one people call the evening star or the morning star.

00:09.162 --> 00:14.625
It is the size of the Earth, wrapped in cloud that throws most of its sunlight back.

00:15.075 --> 00:18.589
In a small telescope it shows phases, like the Moon.
